---
// Nil map panic vs make(), comma-ok existence check, and intentional random map range order.
const W = 900;
const H = 278;
---
<figure class="gf2b">
  <div class="gf2b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Go map rules showing nil map write panic versus initialized make map, comma-ok lookup distinguishing zero values from missing keys, and randomized iteration order.">
      {/* Left panel: Initialization & nil trap */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="424" height="250" rx="10" class="gf2b-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf2b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Nil Map Panic vs. make(map[K]V)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Khởi tạo Map &amp; bẫy panic khi ghi vào nil map</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="392" height="68" rx="6" class="gf2b-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gf2b-b-red">var m map[string]int  // nil pointer!</text>
      <text x="44" y="100" class="gf2b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Reading m["x"] returns 0 safely, BUT m["x"] = 1 PANICS!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc m["x"] trả 0 an toàn, nhưng ghi m["x"] = 1 CRASH ngay!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="116" class="gf2b-m">panic: assignment to entry in nil map</text>

      <rect x="30" y="138" width="392" height="58" rx="6" class="gf2b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="158" class="gf2b-b-ok">m := make(map[string]int, expectedSize)</text>
      <text x="44" y="177" class="gf2b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Allocates hash table; delete(m, k) stays safe on missing keys.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xin bảng băm sẵn; delete(m, k) an toàn cả khi khóa chưa có.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="206" width="392" height="44" rx="6" class="gf2b-box" />
      <text x="44" y="226" class="gf2b-b">Key constraint: must be comparable (==)</text>
      <text x="44" y="242" class="gf2b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Numbers, strings, structs OK; slices/maps cannot be keys.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Số, string, struct thường OK; slice/map/hàm thì không.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: comma-ok & random range */}
      <rect x="458" y="14" width="428" height="250" rx="10" class="gf2b-card" />
      <text x="474" y="42" class="gf2b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Comma-ok Lookup &amp; Random Range Order</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Kiểm tra "comma-ok" &amp; thứ tự duyệt ngẫu nhiên</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="60" width="396" height="56" rx="6" class="gf2b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="488" y="80" class="gf2b-b-ok">scores := map[string]int{'{'}"alice": 0{'}'}</text>
      <text x="488" y="99" class="gf2b-m">v, ok := scores["alice"]  →  v = 0, ok = true (key IS present!)</text>

      <rect x="474" y="126" width="396" height="56" rx="6" class="gf2b-box is-red" />
      <text x="488" y="146" class="gf2b-b-red">w, exists := scores["bob"]  →  w = 0, exists = false</text>
      <text x="488" y="165" class="gf2b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Without ", ok", 0 looks identical for present-zero vs absent key.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không kiểm tra ", ok" thì đều trả về số 0 y hệt nhau.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="192" width="396" height="58" rx="6" class="gf2b-box" />
      <text x="488" y="212" class="gf2b-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>for k, v := range m randomizes start bucket every run!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>for range trên map cố tình xáo ngẫu nhiên mỗi lần chạy!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="488" y="232" class="gf2b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Need stable order? Sort keys via slices.Sorted(maps.Keys(m)).</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cần thứ tự ổn định? Sort key qua slices.Sorted(maps.Keys(m)).</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Initialize Go maps with make() before writing, check ", ok" so zero values never masquerade as present keys, and sort keys before rendering output when deterministic ordering matters.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Luôn gọi make() trước khi ghi map, dùng v, ok := m[k] để không nhầm giá trị 0 với thiếu khóa, và sắp xếp danh sách key nếu cần thứ tự ổn định.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf2b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf2b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf2b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf2b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf2b-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf2b-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf2b-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf2b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2b-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf2b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf2b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf2b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf2b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
